<section class="tc-website" aria-label="Website"><div class="tc-webBackdropLayer" aria-hidden="true"><div class="tc-webBackdrop"></div></div><header class="tc-head tc-head--split"><div><p class="tc-eyebrow" data-tc-enter>Website</p><h2 data-tc-enter>From introduction to registration,<br />one continuous event site</h2></div><p class="tc-desc" data-tc-enter>The global page listed event information mostly as text. To let attendees see why they should come just by scrolling, session topics became image cards and photos from last year's customer sessions convey the event's energy up front. Sessions and speakers are organized into a card-based agenda, and register buttons sit wherever interest peaks so it turns straight into sign-ups.</p></header>
