<section class="tc-process" aria-label="Process"><header class="tc-head tc-head--right"><div><p class="tc-eyebrow" data-tc-enter>Process</p><h2 data-tc-enter>Starting from the content plan,<br />refined through three rounds</h2></div><p class="tc-desc" data-tc-enter>The client's content plan placed Seoul event information onto the global page structure. With no web guideline available, we took only Tanium's brand colors and designed the layout from scratch, following the plan's order of information. Round by round, tables and text-heavy listings became card- and photo-led sections, giving the Korean event a richer presence than the global page.</p></header>
